```
⑩ Dispose:`lifetime.Cancel();` 的下一行加 `patrolLifetime.Cancel();`。只加这一行。
⑪ 不许动的方法(SHAPE 会和改动前逐字比):Schedule、RunScheduledAsync、FailAsync、AbandonAsync、MaybeAbandonAfterLoginFailureAsync、ConnectAsync(bool fromUser)、RefreshSessionAsync、ChangeSessionSourceAsync、ExecuteAsync、ExecuteEffectsAsync、FetchSessionAsync、ApplySessionAsync、RenewAsync、CheckExitAsync、CheckEnvironmentAsync、PatrolNewExecutablesAsync、JournalPatrol。巡检间隔 60 秒不变。文件里不许再出现 `Schedule(PatrolInterval`。

二、测试(winclient/WinClient.Tests/ControllerTests.cs;替身用文件里现成的 Timers、Firewall、Tunnel、ObservableTunnel、ScriptedSource、MemoryRouting、Ok(...)、Until(...)、ScopeOf(...)、ScopeDir、ScopeSelected、TestData)
⑫ 加两个私有成员(照抄),放在 FireAndPublish 后面。停住时不能用 FireAndPublish,它拿 ConnectAsync 当屏障,会真的去连:
```
    private static async Task FireParkedPatrol(ClientController controller, Timers timers)
    {
        var published = Volatile.Read(ref timers.Published);
        timers.Fire("巡检", d => d == TimeSpan.FromSeconds(60));
        await Until(() => Volatile.Read(ref timers.Published) > published);
        await controller.RefreshSessionAsync(); // 串行锁屏障;没连着时它什么都不做。
    }

    /// <summary>第一次启动抛「找不到内核」,之后成功。</summary>
    private sealed class FirstStartMissingTunnel(List<string> order) : ITunnelTransport
    {
        private int starts;
        public event EventHandler? TunnelDown { add { } remove { } }
        public Task StartAsync(JsonElement configuration, CancellationToken token)
        {
            order.Add("start");
            if (Interlocked.Increment(ref starts) == 1) throw new FileNotFoundException("测试:找不到内核");
            return Task.CompletedTask;
        }
        public void Stop() => order.Add("stop");
        public void Dispose() { }
    }
```
